# Allowlist: ignore everything by default (data may contain patient-level info),
# then explicitly re-include only reviewed file types.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.md
!*.yaml
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# provenance: track environment records only (the file manifest stays local)
!provenance/
!provenance/dr_ssl_sl_pip_freeze.txt
!provenance/environment_info.txt
!provenance/audit_tools_pip_freeze.txt
!provenance/static_reports/
!provenance/static_reports/*.txt
